      "type": "text",
      "fontSize": 24,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "text": "Important write-path notes",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "baseline": 24,
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Important write-path notes",
      "lineHeight": 1.35,
      "index": "b17",
      "autoResize": true
    },
    {
      "id": "1e23c6761607457984bf",
      "strokeColor": "#334155",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "angle": 0,
      "x": 1680,
      "y": 985,
      "width": 495,
      "height": 50,
      "seed": 24417067,
      "version": 2,
      "versionNonce": 1388823486,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1783773772826,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "type": "text",
      "fontSize": 15,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "text": "• Durability: official docs state data is written to CommitLog and Memtable; CommitLog protects acknowledged writes during crashes.",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "baseline": 15,
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "• Durability: official docs state data is written to CommitLog and Memtable; CommitLog protects acknowledged writes during crashes.",
      "lineHeight": 1.35,
      "index": "b18",
      "autoResize": true
    },
    {
      "id": "89533c1e6daf45e5b44c",
      "strokeColor": "#334155",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "angle": 0,
      "x": 1680,
      "y": 1037,
      "width": 495,
      "height": 50,
      "seed": 1207657136,
      "version": 2,
      "versionNonce": 1901453090,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1783773772826,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "type": "text",
      "fontSize": 15,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "text": "• Startup recovery: on restart, Cassandra replays CommitLog entries that were not yet flushed to SSTables.",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "baseline": 15,
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "• Startup recovery: on restart, Cassandra replays CommitLog entries that were not yet flushed to SSTables.",
      "lineHeight": 1.35,
      "index": "b19",
      "autoResize": true
    },
    {
      "id": "9be9a608b702412db90c",
      "strokeColor": "#334155",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "angle": 0,
      "x": 1680,
      "y": 1089,
      "width": 495,
      "height": 50,
      "seed": 716585076,
      "version": 2,
      "versionNonce": 1590991870,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1783773772826,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "type": "text",
      "fontSize": 15,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "text": "• CommitLog sync modes: periodic, group, or batch. In batch/group, ACK waits for fsync; in periodic, fsync happens on schedule.",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "baseline": 15,
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "• CommitLog sync modes: periodic, group, or batch. In batch/group, ACK waits for fsync; in periodic, fsync happens on schedule.",
      "lineHeight": 1.35,
      "index": "b1A",
      "autoResize": true
    },
    {
      "id": "e5bc1cff9a794e729c3b",
      "strokeColor": "#334155",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "angle": 0,
      "x": 1680,
      "y": 1141,
      "width": 495,
      "height": 50,
      "seed": 2133283798,
      "version": 2,
      "versionNonce": 458336994,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1783773772826,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "type": "text",
      "fontSize": 15,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "text": "• Hinted handoff: if a replica is down/unreachable, the coordinator can store a hint and replay it later when the node comes back.",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "baseline": 15,
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "• Hinted handoff: if a replica is down/unreachable, the coordinator can store a hint and replay it later when the node comes back.",
      "lineHeight": 1.35,
      "index": "b1B",
      "autoResize": true
    },
    {
      "id": "b5e8fb8c8eee4acba21d",
      "strokeColor": "#334155",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "angle": 0,
      "x": 1680,
      "y": 1193,
      "width": 495,
      "height": 50,
      "seed": 1187071882,
      "version": 2,
      "versionNonce": 1008495678,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1783773772826,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "type": "text",
      "fontSize": 15,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "text": "• Deletes are writes too: Cassandra writes tombstones, which are later removed during compaction after grace period rules.",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "baseline": 15,
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "• Deletes are writes too: Cassandra writes tombstones, which are later removed during compaction after grace period rules.",
      "lineHeight": 1.35,
      "index": "b1C",
      "autoResize": true
    },
    {
      "id": "c0375ede5f0a4c969146",
      "strokeColor": "#334155",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "angle": 0,
      "x": 1680,
      "y": 1245,
      "width": 495,
      "height": 50,
      "seed": 2053821122,
      "version": 2,
      "versionNonce": 1935539874,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1783773772826,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "type": "text",
      "fontSize": 15,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "text": "• Writes are fast because they are append-oriented and avoid in-place updates of on-disk SSTables.",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "baseline": 15,
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "• Writes are fast because they are append-oriented and avoid in-place updates of on-disk SSTables.",
      "lineHeight": 1.35,
      "index": "b1D",
      "autoResize": true
    },
    {
